# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Browserslist
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Shared browser-support policy for Ego Hygiene applications, documentation,
# component tooling, and compatible CSS transformation tools.
#
# Production targets the Baseline Widely Available feature set. This provides
# a stable compatibility window while still supporting downstream browsers
# based on compatible Chromium and Gecko engine versions.
#
# Browserslist is consumed by tools such as Autoprefixer and PostCSS plugins.
# Vite maintains its own JavaScript build target separately.
#
# Inspect the resolved targets:
#
#   pnpm exec browserslist
#   BROWSERSLIST_ENV=development pnpm exec browserslist
#   BROWSERSLIST_ENV=test pnpm exec browserslist
#
# Update the compatibility database:
#
#   pnpm exec update-browserslist-db latest
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

